{"title":"Career roadmap · Warehouse Supervisor","role":"Warehouse Supervisor","summary":"A Warehouse Supervisor coordinates day-to-day warehouse activities including receiving, put-away, storage, picking, packing, dispatch, inventory accuracy, workforce allocation, safety and warehouse performance.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1","Current degree":"BBA / BMS / BBM (Bachelor of Business Administration / Management Studies)","Course":"BBA – Logistics & Supply Chain"},"about":[{"label":"Core combination","text":"Warehouse operations + inventory + WMS/ERP + people management + analytics"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A BBA in Logistics & Supply Chain provides a strong direct foundation, although Warehouse Executive / Warehouse Coordinator / Inventory Executive is often the first entry-level position before moving into a Supervisor role."},{"type":"h","text":"Typical route"},{"type":"flow","items":["BBA Logistics & Supply Chain","Warehouse/Logistics Internship","Warehouse Executive","Senior Warehouse Executive","Warehouse Supervisor","Assistant Warehouse Manager","Warehouse Manager"]}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career direction"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build warehouse, inventory, logistics, ERP/WMS, Excel and operational-management skills"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Become a strong warehouse supervisor and specialise in e-commerce, distribution, cold chain or automation"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Progress toward Warehouse Manager, Distribution Manager or Supply Chain Manager"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Move into regional logistics, fulfilment, supply-chain leadership or warehouse transformation"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Lo